---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
---

<Site
  title="Third-party notices"
  description="Open-source components included in Runstead, their licenses, and source references."
>
  <section class="page wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Built with open-source software</p>
    <h1>Third-party notices.</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Runstead includes Dagu as its workflow engine, alongside open-source
        libraries. Runstead's application source is private. Each included
        component retains its own license.
      </p>
      <h2>Dagu</h2>
      <p>
        The currently bundled engine is Dagu 2.17.0, distributed under the GNU
        General Public License, version 3.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/dagucloud/dagu/tree/v2.17.0">
            Version-matched upstream source
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/licenses/DAGU-LICENSE.txt">Dagu license</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/licenses/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt">
            Component notices and source references
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Published installers will be accompanied by the applicable source
        materials in their GitHub Release assets.
      </p>
      <h2>Library notices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="/licenses/GO-LICENSES.txt">Go dependencies</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/licenses/MCP-LICENSES.txt">MCP viewer dependencies</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/licenses/DAG-EDITOR-LICENSES.txt">
            Workflow editor dependencies
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="/licenses/MARKDOWN-LICENSES.txt">
            Markdown viewer dependencies
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
